1b:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Revenue cycle management is the discipline of running that whole pipeline as a system. The important insight — and it is genuinely counter-intuitive when you start — is that most revenue is lost at the front end, but the loss only becomes visible at the back end, weeks later, when a denial arrives."}]
